# Build context for apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile (both build from the repo root).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/out
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
.claude
*.md
!apps/web/**/*.md

# Secrets never go into an image — pass them at runtime (docker run --env-file / platform env vars).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
